window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>Shadows of Desire and Destiny</b> is a sweeping romantasy where love collides with power, and every choice reshapes a kingdom’s fate.<br> <br> In a realm of lantern-lit festivals, hushed palace corridors, and ancient magic waking in the dark, a spirited apothecary’s daughter longs for more than duty—while a brooding heir wrestles with a legacy that could save or shatter the realm. When a chance encounter sparks an impossible connection, their bond is tested by court intrigue, whispered betrayals, and a rising threat older than the crown itself.<br> <br> Secrets smolder, alliances shift, and destiny demands a price. To claim a future together, they must decide what they’re willing to burn—ambition, loyalty, or their own hearts.<br> <br> Perfect for fans of <b>slow-burn tension, court politics, and lush worldbuilding</b>, <i>Shadows of Desire and Destiny</i> delivers aching romance, high stakes, and the kind of finale that lingers long after the final tick.</p>"; 
